---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Satiation"
  description="About: Satiation & Scarcity after Free AI — OpenIE living whitepaper. Interactive first; PDF twin."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Paper 2 · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Satiation &amp; Scarcity after Free AI
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Capability scales. Appetite does not. Design to done.
      This living paper frames satiation and scarcity when inference is cheap:
      bliss surfaces, honesty about surrogates, and no invented board watts.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      Status: P0 interactive shells + <code class="text-brand-cyan">sat-3d-01</code> bliss-surface stub (textbook modelled).
      Epoch curves cited, not invented. <span class="font-mono text-brand-amber">board_synth_claimed=false</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/satiation/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Open living paper → /papers/satiation/
      </a>
      <a href="/living/pdf-twin/satiation.html" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors">
        PDF twin
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 glass-card p-6 space-y-3">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Paths</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/papers/satiation/</span> → living shell (redirect to <span class="text-brand-cyan">/living/satiation/</span>)</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate">Contract + inventory: openie-web <span class="text-brand-cyan">research/</span> + wca-lut-edge artifacts</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
